  "Work Space｜置物櫃牆與會議區": "Work Space｜Locker Wall and Meeting Area",
  "Work Space｜開放式辦公區": "Work Space｜Open-Plan Work Area",
  "※ 積善館旅館內部＆元祿之湯並不對外開放參觀": "* The interior of Sekizenkan and Genroku-no-Yu are not open to outside visitors.",
  "⚙️ 操作說明": "⚙️ Instructions",
  "「BASE」如同選購衣服的 S／M／L 尺寸般，依生活型態挑選適合坪數的別墅，並提供 BLACK／NATURAL 兩種外觀配色，是相澤陽介以時尚設計師視角詮釋居所的實驗性提案。": "Just as one chooses clothing in S, M, or L, \"BASE\" lets residents select a villa sized to their lifestyle, offered in BLACK or NATURAL exteriors — an experimental proposal in which Yosuke Aizawa reinterprets the home through the eyes of a fashion designer.",
  "「TOJI（湯治）」取自日本傳統中「長期於溫泉地靜養、調理身心」的養生文化，呼應建案以溫泉為核心的生活提案——現代版的「山頂溫泉集落」。": "The name TOJI (湯治), meaning long-term hot-spring recuperation, draws on the traditional Japanese practice of extended stays at hot-spring retreats to rest and restore body and mind. It echoes the property's onsen-centered vision for living — a modern take on the mountaintop hot-spring village.",
  "一日僅接待一組屋主／會員": "Hosts only one owner or member party per day",
  "一日遊參考": "Day Trip Reference",
  "三層貫穿挑高＋螺旋梯": "A soaring void with a spiral staircase running through all three floors",
  "三日餐食選項": "Three-Day Dining Options",
  "上一張": "Previous",
  "下一張": "Next",
  "不只是員工辦公室，同時也是屋主可使用的複合場域，館內併設由 NIGO® 監製的專屬貴賓室「THE NIGO LOUNGE」。": "More than a staff office, it also functions as a mixed-use space open to owners, housing THE NIGO LOUNGE, an exclusive VIP lounge directed by NIGO®.",
  "中": "中",
  "主廚｜林亮治": "Chef | Ryoji Hayashi",
  "主要設施": "Key Amenities",
  "交通方式": "Access",
  "享用以高原捲心菜製作的餃子鍋物，這道特別菜單還能體驗親手「包捲」的樂趣。": "Enjoy a hot pot of gyoza made with highland cabbage — a special menu that lets you experience the joy of hand-wrapping your own dumplings.",
  "介紹": "Details",
  "以「倉庫建築」為基底，最大化發揮既有量體的潛力，在大膽的工業感結構中，處處埋入 NOT A HOTEL 式的「WOW（驚喜）」設計巧思，將品牌的空間體驗哲學延伸至日常工作場域。": "Built on the foundation of a \"warehouse building,\" the design maximizes the potential of the existing volume, weaving NOT A HOTEL's signature \"WOW\" (surprise) design touches throughout its bold industrial structure — extending the brand's philosophy of spatial experience into the everyday workplace.",
  "以獨特造型聞名的設計椅「PRATONE」，結合粉紅與綠色演繹出令人聯想到櫻花的空間。彷彿撥開草叢般將身體埋入其中放鬆，也是極具話題性的拍照打卡點。": "The PRATONE, a design chair famed for its distinctive form, pairs pink and green to conjure a space evocative of cherry blossoms. Sinking into it feels like wading into a field of grass — and it has become one of the space's most talked-about photo spots.",
  "以藝術環繞的極簡空間手法，營造讓對話與思考能自由開展的氛圍，內外反差強烈——樸素立面下是精雕細琢的沉浸式室內體驗。": "A minimalist spatial approach surrounded by art creates an atmosphere where conversation and thought can unfold freely, producing a striking contrast between inside and out — behind the modest facade lies a meticulously crafted, immersive interior experience.",
  "位於 NOT A HOTEL OFFICE（晴海總部）內、由 NIGO® 親自操刀設計的專屬屋主貴賓室。空間融合 NIGO® 一貫的次文化收藏美學與家具選品，是僅限屋主使用的隱密社交場域，晚餐將於此享用主廚特別課程。（完整介紹將於地點總覽功能上線後更新）": "Located within NOT A HOTEL OFFICE (Harumi headquarters), this owners-only VIP lounge was designed personally by NIGO®. The space blends NIGO®'s signature subculture-collector aesthetic with curated furniture selections, forming a private social sanctuary reserved exclusively for homeowners; dinner here will feature a special chef's tasting course. (Full details will be updated once the location overview feature launches.)",
  "位於四萬溫泉最深處、由四萬川水壩攔蓄而成的湖泊，湖水呈現夢幻的鈷藍色，人稱「四萬藍（Shima Blue）」。晴天時湖面湛藍透亮，自壩頂展望點可將整片藍色湖景與上信越高原的群山盡收眼底，是群馬屈指可數的秘境絕景。行程於展望點短暫停留賞湖拍照。": "Located deep within Shima Onsen, this reservoir lake formed by the Shimagawa Dam glows in a dreamlike cobalt blue known as \"Shima Blue.\" On clear days the water turns a brilliant, luminous blue, and the dam-top viewpoint offers sweeping views of the lake and the mountains of Jōshin'etsu Kōgen — one of Gunma's foremost hidden scenic wonders. The itinerary includes a brief stop at the viewpoint to take in the view and photograph the lake.",
  "位於東京都中央區晴海 4 丁目 7 番 4 號「CROSS DOCK HARUMI」1 樓，鄰近東京灣沿岸開發區域。建築以既有倉庫建物改建而成，兼具工業感量體與精緻室內體驗的反差。": "Located on the first floor of CROSS DOCK HARUMI at 4-7-4 Harumi, Chūō-ku, Tokyo, near the redevelopment area along Tokyo Bay. Converted from an existing warehouse structure, the building plays on the contrast between its raw industrial volume and a refined interior experience.",
  "位於東京都中央區晴海 NOT A HOTEL OFFICE 建築內，該棟辦公室以倉庫建築改建而成，THE NIGO LOUNGE 是其中的重點特色空間之一。": "Located within NOT A HOTEL OFFICE in Harumi, Chūō-ku, Tokyo — an office converted from a former warehouse building — THE NIGO LOUNGE stands as one of its signature spaces.",
  "位於東京都廣尾，從廣尾大通轉入巷弄後才浮現的厚重立面建築，外觀低調，如同隱世據點，鄰近西麻布、六本木等高端商業與住宅區。": "Located in Hiroo, Tokyo, the building's substantial facade only comes into view after turning off Hiroo Dori into a side street. Its understated presence reads like a hidden retreat, set near the upscale commercial and residential districts of Nishi-Azabu and Roppongi.",
  "位於東京都心的 TOKYO 屋主專用貴賓室。由總監 NIGO® 世界觀凝縮而成的空間，無論會議、商談或派對，公私場合皆能對應，並備有精選的餐飲服務。": "An owners-only VIP lounge in the heart of Tokyo. A space distilled from Creative Director NIGO®'s worldview, equally suited to meetings, business discussions, or private parties, complete with a curated dining service.",
  "位於東京都浅草，距浅草寺步行僅數分鐘。建築前身為一棟屋齡超過 50 年的老舗家具店，外觀低調不起眼，內部卻別有洞天，被形容為「都市裡的秘密基地」。": "Located in Asakusa, Tokyo, just a few minutes' walk from Sensō-ji temple. The building was once a long-established furniture shop over 50 years old; its unassuming exterior conceals a world apart within, often described as \"a secret base hidden in the city.\"",
