  "保留老家具店建築的歷史痕跡，貫穿三層樓的挑高螺旋梯與巨大音響裝置串連起垂直動線，讓訪客推開厚重大門後，彷彿進入與外界隔絕的非日常異空間。": "Traces of the building's history as a furniture shop have been preserved, while a soaring spiral staircase and a monumental sound installation link the vertical circulation across three floors. Once visitors push open the heavy door, they step into an extraordinary space set apart from the everyday world outside.",
