  "停車場：四萬川水壩停車場（壩頂旁、免費、靠近展望點步道入口，約9個車位）―": "Parking: Shimagawa Dam Parking Lot (beside the dam top, free, near the viewpoint trailhead, approx. 9 spaces) —",
  "備用停車場：四萬川水壩大型停車場（Shimagawa Dam Ogata Parking Lot，車位較多，從上方停車場徒步約7分鐘）―": "Alternate Parking: Shimagawa Dam Ogata Parking Lot (more spaces available, approx. 7-minute walk from the upper parking lot) —",
  "僅限 NOT A HOTEL 屋主使用，作為總部內的專屬社交與接待場域。": "Reserved exclusively for NOT A HOTEL owners, serving as a private social and reception space within the headquarters.",
  "僅限 NOT A HOTEL 屋主與會員預約使用，餐廳採一天僅接待一組客人的形式，提供高度隱私、包場式的宴會體驗。": "Reservations are open exclusively to NOT A HOTEL owners and members. The restaurant hosts only one party per day, offering a highly private, fully exclusive banquet experience.",
  "僅限 NOT A HOTEL 屋主與會員預約，作為私人聚會、商談與社交的隱密據點。": "Reservations are open exclusively to NOT A HOTEL owners and members, serving as a discreet venue for private gatherings, business discussions, and social occasions.",
