  "內含：陶鍋炊飯・味噌湯・炭烤赤城牛菲力牛排・兩款時令小缽・新鮮沙拉・甜點。＊食材可能依季節供應狀況而有所調整。": "Includes: clay-pot rice, miso soup, charcoal-grilled Akagi beef fillet steak, two seasonal small dishes, fresh salad, and dessert. *Ingredients may be adjusted according to seasonal availability.",
