  "可搭配特製烤地瓜（お芋）：餐廳結合「地瓜專賣」特色，提供將熱騰騰的蜜地瓜（烤番薯）頂部加上這款冰涼牛乳霜淇淋的組合，享受「冷熱交融」的招牌甜點體驗。": "Pairs with Specialty Baked Sweet Potato (Oimo): True to the restaurant's sweet-potato specialty, a warm honeyed baked sweet potato is topped with this chilled milk soft-serve — a signature dessert experience where hot meets cold.",
  "名稱": "Name",
  "吧檯區｜藝術牆面與中島酒吧": "Bar Area | Art wall and island bar",
  "吧檯｜黑膠音響與迎賓吧檯": "Bar | Vinyl sound system and welcome bar",
  "命名由來": "The Meaning Behind the Name",
  "品牌集團：Aman集團全新姊妹品牌Janu，全球首店": "Brand Group: Janu, Aman Group's new sister brand — its first property worldwide",
