  "圓桌宴會廳｜可容納賓客的胡桃木長桌": "Round Table Banquet Hall | A long walnut table accommodating guests",
  "在餐廳「Kigi」，呈現體現「火與水」理念的柴燒會席料理。使用純淨湧泉水培育食材，再以柴火原始的熱力調理，不拘泥於特定料理形式，展現食材最極致的風味，透過難忘的味覺旅程，感受水上町獨有的風土與文化。如需包廂或吧檯席，請透過禮賓聊天洽詢。由於座位有限，鍋物料理將採輪替供應方式，敬請見諒。": "At the restaurant \"Kigi,\" a wood-fired kaiseki menu brings the concept of \"fire and water\" to life. Ingredients are nurtured with pure spring water, then cooked over the primal heat of an open wood fire — unbound by convention, each dish is coaxed to reveal its fullest flavor, offering an unforgettable culinary journey into the distinctive terroir and culture of Minakami. For private rooms or counter seating, please inquire via the concierge chat. As seating is limited, hot-pot dishes will be served on a rotating basis; thank you for your understanding.",
  "在餐廳「Kigi」，我們呈現體現「火與水」理念的柴燒會席料理。使用純淨湧泉水培育食材，再以柴火原始的熱力調理，不拘泥於特定料理形式，展現食材最極致的風味，透過難忘的味覺旅程，感受水上町獨有的風土與文化。如需包廂或吧檯席，請透過禮賓聊天洽詢。由於座位有限，鍋物料理將採輪替供應方式，敬請見諒。": "At our restaurant, Kigi, we present wood-fired kaiseki cuisine built around the philosophy of 'fire and water.' Ingredients are nurtured with pure spring water, then coaxed over the primal heat of an open wood fire — unbound by any single style of cooking, each dish is drawn out to reveal its truest flavor. It is an unforgettable culinary journey into the distinctive terroir and culture of Minakami Town. For private rooms or counter seating, please inquire through the concierge chat. As seating is limited, hot pot dishes will be served on a rotating basis — we appreciate your understanding.",
