  "大型暖爐、中島廚房、戶外露台、岩風呂溫泉、桑拿": "Large fireplace, kitchen island, outdoor terrace, rock-bath onsen, sauna",
  "大開窗引入森林景致，戶外露台可圍爐夜談，岩風呂溫泉滿足日常泡湯需求；室內家具選用 Fritz Hansen「Grand Prix」椅，並採用相澤陽介親自設計的專屬布料訂製，呼應時尚與居住美學的跨界結合。": "Expansive windows draw the surrounding forest indoors, the outdoor terrace invites fireside conversation late into the night, and a rock-bath onsen answers the daily call for a soak. Interiors are furnished with the Fritz Hansen \"Grand Prix\" chair, custom-upholstered in fabric designed by Aizawa himself — a crossover of fashion and residential aesthetics.",
  "天氣參考": "Weather",
  "奧四萬湖": "Oku-Shima Lake",
