  "客廳以 180° 環繞方式被無邊際泳池、天然溫泉與水風呂包圍，讓「水」的體驗滲透日常起居，四季皆可欣賞不同的絕景變化，體現「湯治」靜養身心的核心精神。": "The living room is wrapped in a 180-degree embrace of infinity pool, natural onsen, and cold-water bath, letting the experience of water permeate everyday life. Each season brings a different breathtaking view, embodying the restorative spirit of toji at the heart of the design.",
  "客房數：全122間": "Rooms: 122 total",
  "室內 158.65㎡＋戶外 156.55㎡（總計315.20㎡）": "Interior 158.65㎡ + Outdoor 156.55㎡ (Total 315.20㎡)",
  "室內壁爐、完備的現代廚房、可容 8 人的餐桌": "Indoor fireplace, a fully equipped modern kitchen, dining table for 8",
  "室內建築面積": "Building Floor Area",
  "室內設施": "Interior Amenities",
  "室內設計師／Wonderwall® 代表。片山正通率領的 Wonderwall®，以具現化概念時的自由發想，以及在敬重傳統與樣式的同時融入現代元素的平衡感，獲得國際高度評價。作品橫跨精品店、品牌空間到大型商業設施的整體規劃。代表作包括 NOWHERE（BUSY WORK SHOP® 原宿）、日本外務省主導的海外據點事業 JAPAN HOUSE LONDON、UNIQLO 全球旗艦店（紐約、巴黎、銀座等）、THE TOKYO TOILET 惠比壽公園等。並曾獲荷蘭設計雜誌《FRAME》主辦「FRAME AWARD 2020」終身成就獎。除 HIROO CLUB HOUSE 外，亦操刀「NOT A HOTEL KITAKARUIZAWA MASU」。": "Interior designer and representative of Wonderwall®. Masamichi Katayama's Wonderwall® has earned international acclaim for the free-spirited imagination behind its concept realization, and for a refined balance that honors tradition and established forms while weaving in contemporary elements. His work spans boutiques, brand environments, and comprehensive planning for large-scale commercial facilities, with signature projects including NOWHERE (BUSY WORK SHOP® Harajuku), JAPAN HOUSE LONDON — an overseas cultural outpost led by Japan's Ministry of Foreign Affairs — global UNIQLO flagship stores (New York, Paris, Ginza, and others), and THE TOKYO TOILET at Ebisu Park. He also received the lifetime achievement honor at the FRAME AWARD 2020, presented by the Dutch design magazine FRAME. In addition to HIROO CLUB HOUSE, he also designed NOT A HOTEL KITAKARUIZAWA MASU.",
  "室內面積": "Interior Area",
  "室內｜中島廚房與圓桌，螺旋梯貫穿三層樓": "Interior | Island kitchen and round table, with a spiral staircase running through three floors",
  "室內｜層高6米的高階木造屋頂結構": "Interior | A Soaring 6-Meter-High Timber Roof Structure",
  "屋主／會員預約制": "Reservation only, for owners and members",
  "屋齡": "Building Age",
  "山景全景視野": "Panoramic mountain views",
  "山景全景視野、戶外溫泉浴池（onsen）、室內壁爐、無邊際泳池、桑拿、可容8人的餐桌": "Panoramic mountain views, outdoor onsen bath, indoor fireplace, infinity pool, sauna, dining table for 8",
  "山頂共規劃 5 棟獨立villa（首批已於2025年5月開業）": "5 standalone villas planned atop the summit (the first opened in May 2025)",
  "已預定 2 rooms": "2 rooms reserved",
  "座落於群馬縣嬬恋村北輕井澤地區，距輕井澤車站車程約 30 分鐘，位於淺間山麓的森林之中，環境清幽、幾乎不受外界干擾，周邊亦有滑雪場、溫泉等活動資源，適合都心與山林的兩地生活。": "Set among the forests at the foot of Mt. Asama in the Kitakaruizawa area of Tsumagoi Village, Gunma Prefecture, roughly 30 minutes by car from Karuizawa Station, the property enjoys a tranquil setting all but untouched by the outside world. Nearby ski slopes and onsen add to its appeal as a retreat for those splitting their time between the city and the mountains.",
  "座落於群馬縣水上町山頂，距東京都心車程約 2 小時。水上町地處利根川源流，水質優良、四季分明，周邊亦有天然溫泉、泛舟、滑雪、高爾夫等戶外活動資源。基地本身可 360° 眺望群山與雲海，是山頂上獨立的秘境。": "Set atop a mountain summit in Minakami, Gunma Prefecture, roughly two hours by car from central Tokyo. Minakami lies at the headwaters of the Tone River, prized for its pristine water and four distinct seasons, with natural hot springs, river rafting, skiing, and golf all found nearby. The site itself commands 360-degree views of the surrounding mountains and seas of cloud, a secluded retreat set apart atop the summit.",
  "建案規模": "Property Scale",
  "建築型態": "Building Type",
  "建築物及設施共有持分，土地連帶借地權": "Co-ownership share in the building and facilities, with joint leasehold rights to the land",
  "建築確認編號": "Building Confirmation No.",
  "建築規模": "Architecture",
  "建築設計": "Architecture",
  "從廣尾大通轉入巷弄後浮現的厚重立面，如隱世據點般的建築由室內設計大師片山正通（Wonderwall® 代表）操刀，藝術環繞的極簡空間讓對話與思考自由開展。3樓為可容納8人的私人餐廳，由米其林一星「白寧」主廚掌廚的法式料理及專屬酒窖；4樓則是沙發環繞、適合腦力激盪與簡報的會議室，是屋主聚會、商談的隱密據點。": "Turning off Hiroo's main avenue into a quiet side street reveals a solid, understated facade — a hideaway-like building designed by master interior designer Masamichi Katayama, representative of Wonderwall®, where art-filled minimalist spaces invite free-flowing conversation and thought. The 3rd floor houses a private dining room seating 8, serving French cuisine by Michelin one-star Chef Bai Ning alongside a dedicated wine cellar; the 4th floor is a sofa-lined meeting room suited to brainstorming and presentations — a discreet venue for homeowners' gatherings and discussions.",
  "我們在餐廳「Sekiboku」提供傳統日式和風早餐。": "We serve a traditional Japanese breakfast at our restaurant, Sekiboku.",
  "我們將於 Fire Pit 戶外區域為您架設 BBQ 烤爐與食材（不含烹調服務）。如遇雨天，我們將於前一日下午與您聯繫，討論菜單調整或取消事宜。": "We will set up a BBQ grill and ingredients for you at the outdoor Fire Pit area (cooking service not included). In the event of rain, we will contact you the previous afternoon to discuss menu adjustments or cancellation.",
  "我們為您準備西式早餐組，於房內享用（不含烹調服務）。前一晚送達房內的早餐組包含：可頌與吐司、特製蛤蜊巧達湯（加熱即可享用）、高原蔬菜沙拉（即可食用）、優格與自製穀麥。在動手準備、享用現做早餐的樂趣中展開美好的一天。早餐組將於前一晚 17:00–20:00 送達房內冰箱。若您不在房內，將徵得同意後代為放入冰箱。如有指定送達時間需求，請於當日 17:00 前告知。": "We prepare a Western-style breakfast set for you to enjoy in your room (cooking service not included). Delivered to your room the evening before, the set includes: croissants and toast, our signature clam chowder (ready to enjoy after reheating), a highland vegetable salad (ready to eat), yogurt, and house-made granola. Begin your day with the simple pleasure of preparing and savoring a freshly made breakfast at your own pace. The breakfast set will be delivered to your in-room refrigerator between 17:00 and 20:00 the evening before. If you are not in your room at the time, we will place it in the refrigerator with your prior consent. Please let us know by 17:00 that day if you have a preferred delivery time.",
  "戶型": "Layout",
  "戶外 BBQ（Fire Pit）": "Outdoor BBQ (Fire Pit)",
  "戶外溫泉浴池（onsen）、室內溫泉、無邊際泳池、桑拿、冷水浴（16°C）": "Outdoor onsen bath, indoor onsen, infinity pool, sauna, cold plunge (16°C)",
