  "採用群馬在地品牌「上州豚」：嚴選群馬縣當地飼育的上州豬肉，肉質鮮嫩無腥味，油脂分佈均勻且甘甜。": "Featuring the Local Gunma Brand \"Joshu Pork\": Carefully selected Joshu pork raised locally in Gunma Prefecture, prized for its tender, odor-free meat and evenly marbled, naturally sweet fat.",
  "推薦餐點：釜揚烏龍麵、上州豬肉三味套餐、群馬牛奶霜淇淋。": "Recommended dishes: kamaage udon, Joshu pork three-ways set, and Gunma milk soft-serve.",
  "提供房間至餐廳的接駁服務": "Shuttle service is provided between the rooms and the restaurant",
  "支援資訊": "Support",
  "放大檢視": "Zoom In",
  "於六本木「東泉閣」享用專屬包場的私人晚宴體驗，每日僅接待一組賓客。適合朋友聚會、團隊聚餐或家庭派對。晚宴課程自 ¥21,780 起。範例菜單：三款前菜・點心拼盤・紅燒魚翅・北京烤鴨（單品）・海鮮主菜・肉類主菜・麻婆豆腐・麵飯類・甜點。可依預算彈性升級菜色。適合 6 至 12 位賓客，詳情請洽詢我們的禮賓服務。": "Enjoy a private, exclusively booked dinner experience at Tōsenkaku (Roppongi), which welcomes only one party per day. Ideal for gatherings with friends, team dinners, or family celebrations. Dinner courses start from ¥21,780. Sample menu: three appetizers, an assorted dim sum platter, braised shark fin soup, Peking duck (a la carte), a seafood main, a meat main, mapo tofu, noodles or rice, and dessert. The menu can be flexibly upgraded according to your budget. Suited to 6–12 guests; please consult our concierge service for details.",
  "於六本木「東泉閣」享用專屬包場的私人晚宴體驗，每日僅接待一組賓客，適合朋友聚會、團隊會議或家庭派對等各式聚餐與飲酒場合。大盤派對課程自 9,680 日圓起／全程3小時暢飲方案 6,050 日圓起。範例菜單：兩款前菜・兩款點心・三款主菜（如炸雞佐辣醬、辣味蝦、糖醋豬肉等）・麻婆豆腐・炒飯・甜點。酒精飲品：朝日啤酒、無糖啤酒、High Ball、檸檬沙瓦、紹興酒、大麥燒酎、琴通寧、卡西斯柳橙、蜜桃烏龍、氣泡酒、白酒、紅酒；無酒精飲品：無酒精啤酒、薑汁汽水、可樂、烏龍茶、綠茶、柳橙汁、蘋果汁。＊可依預算彈性升級。＊適合 13 至 50 位賓客。": "Enjoy a private, exclusively booked dinner experience at Tōsenkaku (Roppongi), which welcomes only one party per day — ideal for gatherings with friends, team meetings, family parties, and other social or drinking occasions. Large-plate party courses start from ¥9,680, or choose the plan with 3 hours of free-flow drinks from ¥6,050. Sample menu: two appetizers, two dim sum dishes, three main dishes (such as fried chicken with chili sauce, spicy prawns, and sweet and sour pork), mapo tofu, fried rice, and dessert. Alcoholic drinks: Asahi beer, non-alcoholic beer, highball, lemon sour, Shaoxing wine, mugi shochu, gin and tonic, cassis orange, peach oolong, sparkling wine, white wine, and red wine; non-alcoholic drinks: non-alcoholic beer, ginger ale, cola, oolong tea, green tea, orange juice, and apple juice. *Flexible upgrades available according to budget. *Suited to 13–50 guests.",
  "於房內自助享用大和豚常夜鍋（火鍋料理）套餐（不含烹調服務）。": "Enjoy a self-serve Yamato pork jōya-nabe (hot pot) set in the comfort of your room (cooking service not included).",
  "於房內自助享用水炊鍋套餐（不含烹調服務）。": "Enjoy a self-serve mizutaki hot pot set in the comfort of your room (cooking service not included).",
  "於房內自助享用赤城牛涮涮鍋套餐（不含烹調服務）。": "Enjoy a self-serve Akagi beef shabu-shabu set in the comfort of your room (cooking service not included).",
  "於房內自助享用野味鍋套餐（不含烹調服務）。": "Enjoy a self-serve Jibie Nabe (wild game hot pot) set in the comfort of your room (cooking service not included).",
  "於房內自助享用鍋物套餐，使用新鮮鴨肉與在地蔬菜（不含烹調服務）。": "Enjoy a self-serve hot pot set featuring fresh duck and local vegetables in the comfort of your room (cooking service not included).",
  "於房內自在享用自助式鍋物體驗（不含烹調服務）。這道特別料理使用佐渡優質海鮮與谷川岳新鮮山產食材，佐以風味絕佳的薑味噌湯底。": "Enjoy a relaxed, self-serve hot pot experience in your room (cooking service not included). This special dish features premium seafood from Sado and fresh mountain ingredients from Mt. Tanigawa, in a flavorful ginger miso broth.",
  "於餐廳 Kigi 供應的傳統日式早餐，土鍋炊飯與湧泉滋養的在地食材。": "A traditional Japanese breakfast served at restaurant Kigi, featuring clay-pot rice and local ingredients nurtured by spring water.",
  "於餐廳「Sekiboku」供應的傳統日式和風早餐。": "A traditional Japanese breakfast served at the restaurant \"Sekiboku.\"",
