  "日本群馬縣四萬溫泉的百年老字號旅館，是日本現存最古老的木造溫泉旅館建築（據傳也是《神隱少女》油屋的靈感來源之一）。": "A century-old, long-established inn in Shima Onsen, Gunma Prefecture, and Japan's oldest surviving wooden hot-spring inn building — reputedly one of the inspirations for the bathhouse in Spirited Away.",
