  "景觀由 SOLSO 代表齊藤太一操刀（作品包括東京南青山「SHARE GREEN MINAMI AOYAMA」），植栽配置模擬穿越森林後豁然開朗的「村落」意象。": "The landscape was designed by Taichi Saito, representative of SOLSO (whose works include SHARE GREEN MINAMI AOYAMA in Tokyo's Minami-Aoyama district), with plantings arranged to evoke the sense of stepping out of a forest into an open \"village.\"",
