  "最大亮點：都內規模最大級的健康養生設施（約4,000㎡），含25米溫水泳池、7間療程室、5個運動教室（飛輪、拳擊、瑜伽、模擬高爾夫等）；館內8間餐廳酒吧全部自營、風格迥異": "Highlights: One of Tokyo's largest wellness facilities (approx. 4,000 sqm), featuring a 25-meter heated pool, 7 treatment rooms, and 5 fitness studios (cycling, boxing, yoga, golf simulator, and more); the property's 8 restaurants and bars are all independently operated, each with its own distinct character",
