  "東京": "Tokyo",
  "東京浅草，屋齡逾50年的獨棟老宅改建。推開厚重大門，貫穿三層樓的挑高螺旋梯與巨大音響裝置迎面而來，空間設計由 DAIKEI MILLS 代表中村圭佑操刀。由「桃仙閣」主廚林亮治坐鎮的現代町中華，是僅限屋主使用、一天僅接待一組客人的專屬圓桌饗宴，用途為私人宴會餐廳。": "Set in a standalone house over 50 years old in Asakusa, Tokyo. Beyond its heavy front door, a soaring three-story spiral staircase and a massive sound system installation greet visitors, in a space designed by Keisuke Nakamura, representative of DAIKEI MILLS. Chef Ryoji Hayashi of Tōsenkaku presides over a modern machi-chuka menu, served as an exclusive round-table feast reserved solely for homeowners and hosting only one party per day — a private banquet restaurant.",
