  "此方案由東京名店「燒肉Jumbo」獨家監修的 NOT A HOTEL 專屬課程打造。由燒肉Jumbo社長難波裕光先生親自於現場為您服務，體驗僅此獨有的頂級燒肉饗宴。內含：綜合前菜・沙拉・Jumbo 頂級黑毛和牛・韓式辣牛肉湯・冷麵・牛肉飯・甜點。＊總消費金額低消為 ¥181,500，若未達此金額，我們將樂於為您推薦酒水或其他飲品補足差額。＊菜單內容為範例，可能依市場供應狀況與季節而有所調整。＊湯品可依需求更換為和牛雲吞湯，如有需要請透過聊天與我們聯繫。": "This exclusive NOT A HOTEL course is crafted under the sole supervision of Tokyo's renowned Yakiniku Jumbo. Hiromitsu Namba, president of Yakiniku Jumbo, will personally attend to you on site for a premium yakiniku experience found nowhere else. Includes: assorted appetizers, salad, Jumbo's premium black wagyu, spicy Korean-style beef soup, cold noodles, beef rice, and dessert. *The minimum spend is ¥181,500; should the total fall short of this amount, we will be happy to recommend wine, sake, or other beverages to make up the difference. *The menu shown is a sample and may be adjusted according to market availability and season. *The soup course can be substituted with a wagyu wonton soup upon request — please let us know via chat if you would like this option.",
  "此方案由東京名店「燒肉Jumbo」獨家監修的 NOT A HOTEL 專屬課程打造，以自助式風格、依個人步調悠閒享用。內含：綜合前菜・沙拉・Jumbo 頂級黑毛和牛・韓式辣牛肉湯・冷麵・甜點。＊總消費金額低消為 ¥181,500，若未達此金額，我們將樂於為您推薦酒水或其他飲品補足差額。": "This exclusive NOT A HOTEL course is crafted under the sole supervision of Tokyo's renowned Yakiniku Jumbo, served self-serve style so you can savor it at your own pace. Includes: assorted appetizers, salad, Jumbo's premium black wagyu, spicy Korean-style beef soup, cold noodles, and dessert. *The minimum spend is ¥181,500; should the total fall short of this amount, we will be happy to recommend wine, sake, or other beverages to make up the difference.",
