  "溫泉水煮麵：麵條直接使用四萬溫泉可飲用的天然湧泉水滾煮，體現積善館數百年「湯治（溫泉療養）」養生文化。": "Boiled in Onsen Water: The noodles are boiled directly in Shima Onsen's potable natural spring water, embodying Sekizenkan's centuries-old culture of toji (hot-spring therapy and wellness).",
