  "積善館由溫泉療養樓的「本館」、旅館樓的「山莊」和「佳松亭」三棟建築組成，沿著山坡通過隧道和樓梯相連。請欣賞三座個性各異的建築。": "Sekizenkan comprises three buildings — the hot-spring therapy building Honkan (Main Building), and the guest lodging buildings Sansō and Kashōtei — connected by tunnels and staircases along the hillside. Take a moment to appreciate the distinct character of each.",
