  "貴賓室：Aman系列品牌沒有傳統club lounge概念——因為全館走「一價全含式高規格服務」路線，貴賓體驗分散在8間餐廳與4,000㎡的Wellness設施中，而非集中於單一貴賓廳": "Club Lounge: Aman-family brands forgo the traditional club lounge concept — with an all-inclusive, high-touch service model throughout the property, the VIP experience is distributed across the 8 restaurants and the 4,000-sqm wellness facility rather than concentrated in a single lounge",
