  "館方人員將於您的房內備妥「水上七輪御膳」（炭火燒烤組），供您隨心享用。套餐內容包含朴葉燒赤城牛（朴葉上炭烤赤城牛）、酒蒸川魚、多款在地常菜、山藥泥與甜點，一同品味水上山川之惠。": "Our staff will set up the 'Minakami Shichirin Course' — a charcoal grill set — in your room for you to enjoy at your own pace. The set includes hoba-yaki Akagi beef (Akagi beef grilled over charcoal on a magnolia leaf), sake-steamed river fish, an array of local everyday dishes, grated yam, and dessert, letting you savor the bounty of Minakami's mountains and rivers together.",
