  "：本館停車場車位數量有限，僅供酒店住客使用，一日遊請使用距離酒店約 5 分鐘的「Kiri no Kihira 停車場」（免費｜地圖代碼 554 033 874*68）": ": Parking at the Main Building is limited and reserved for hotel guests only. Day-trip visitors should use the \"Kiri no Kihira Parking Lot,\" about 5 minutes from the hotel (free · map code 554 033 874*68).",
  "：白天高溫約 30℃，早晚涼爽約 19–20℃，降雨機率偏高（約 60%），早晚溫差大，建議備薄外套。": ": Daytime highs around 30℃, cooler mornings and evenings around 19–20℃, with a relatively high chance of rain (around 60%). The day-night temperature swing is significant, so a light jacket is recommended.",
